.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrcat(char *dest, const char *src);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrcat function appends the string pointed to by src to the end of the string pointed to by dest.

